  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHC frame 2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK ramavtal 2003</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHC is working with media related projects and HR projects in the Western Balkans. The proposal includes 57 projects and additional projects during the year. Support is above all given to media infrastructure, legal advice and minority projects. Direct support to media is being phased out and gradually replaced by credits through e g MDLF.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK arbetar med mediarelaterade projekt samt MR-projekt regionalt i V&#xE4;stra Balkan. Projektans&#xF6;kan omfattar 57 projekt samt tillkommande insatser. St&#xF6;d ges ffa till infrastruktur till medier, juridisk r&#xE5;dgivning, minoritetsprojekt. En gradvis utfasning av direktst&#xF6;d till medier till f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;n f&#xF6;r krediter genom t ex MDLF genomf&#xF6;rs.</narrative>
  </description>
